WEBVTT

01:24.160 --> 01:24.870
I'm the first...

01:24.871 --> 01:26.200
No, I'm the first one.

01:31.580 --> 01:34.040
Hurry up, sister, hurry.

01:34.880 --> 01:35.960
Yes, yes.

01:37.380 --> 01:39.340
Hurry up, hurry.

02:07.450 --> 02:10.370
Lady Mary looks nice and gentle.

02:11.000 --> 02:13.879
I think my mother looked like Lady Mary.

02:13.880 --> 02:15.039
I'm sure she did.

02:15.040 --> 02:16.629
My mother did too.

02:16.630 --> 02:17.799
All right.

02:17.800 --> 02:19.509
Be quiet, everybody.

02:19.510 --> 02:21.170
Yes.

02:24.390 --> 02:28.100
Sister, this picture was
painted by Rubens, wasn't it?

02:28.520 --> 02:30.480
Yes, it was.

02:38.690 --> 02:40.490
I know a painter who is just like...

02:41.150 --> 02:44.490
No, who is much better than Rubens.

02:45.530 --> 02:46.490
Really?

02:46.740 --> 02:48.079
Who is he?

02:48.080 --> 02:49.289
Where is he?

02:49.290 --> 02:50.040
Tell us!

02:50.041 --> 02:51.080
You see...

02:55.750 --> 02:56.670
It's a secret.

02:56.671 --> 02:58.419
That's unfair! Tell us!

02:58.420 --> 03:01.260
Oh, come on. Tell us, please.

03:50.890 --> 03:52.019
Let me see it.

03:52.020 --> 03:53.810
Please, let me see it.

03:55.350 --> 03:56.689
No, Alois.

03:56.690 --> 03:58.479
It's not finished yet.

03:58.480 --> 04:00.149
You're so stingy, Nello.

04:00.150 --> 04:01.229
Not yet.

04:01.230 --> 04:02.439
Just a glance!

04:02.440 --> 04:03.939
Nello!

04:03.940 --> 04:05.449
I said not yet!

04:05.450 --> 04:06.740
Hey, wait!

04:08.990 --> 04:10.530
I'm sorry, Patrash.

04:11.790 --> 04:14.290
Patrash looks so stunned.

04:17.330 --> 04:20.670
Ah, Patrash is mad at me.

04:23.300 --> 04:24.630
He really is.

04:42.150 --> 04:45.110
Wow! Nello has drawn me!

04:45.570 --> 04:46.690
I'm so happy!

04:46.900 --> 04:48.819
Can I have it?

04:48.820 --> 04:50.280
Yes, sure.

04:51.160 --> 04:52.409
Thank you!

04:52.410 --> 04:53.790
It'll be my treasure!

04:55.160 --> 04:58.000
What are you doing here, Alois?

04:59.790 --> 05:01.579
Hello, Mr. Cojez.

05:01.580 --> 05:02.750
Papa!

05:03.340 --> 05:07.340
Alois, you have to return
home before it gets dark.

05:08.050 --> 05:10.339
This is no time...

05:10.340 --> 05:12.930
...for a good girl to be outside.

05:13.390 --> 05:14.719
I'm sorry.

05:14.720 --> 05:17.269
But look, Nello has drawn
a picture for me.

05:17.270 --> 05:18.349
Look, Papa.

05:18.350 --> 05:19.849
Nello is very good at...

05:19.850 --> 05:20.770
A picture?

05:27.820 --> 05:29.990
Are you always doing this foolish thing?

05:31.160 --> 05:32.070
Papa!

05:32.490 --> 05:34.240
Don't waste your time on stupid pictures.

05:35.120 --> 05:38.540
Why don't you help your grandpa
instead of wasting your time like this?

05:38.870 --> 05:40.709
Papa, Nello is...

05:40.710 --> 05:42.170
You be quiet.

05:42.960 --> 05:43.999
But...

05:44.000 --> 05:45.380
Mama is worrying about you.

05:45.880 --> 05:47.550
You go home now.

05:48.550 --> 05:49.920
Can't you hear me?

05:50.510 --> 05:51.340
Yes.

06:03.020 --> 06:04.440
I'll keep this picture.

06:06.020 --> 06:06.570
Take it.

06:07.780 --> 06:10.239
I'll buy it from you. Take it.

06:10.240 --> 06:12.160
No, I don't want the money.

06:12.950 --> 06:13.700
Why not?

06:14.200 --> 06:15.370
Don't you need the money?

06:15.780 --> 06:17.410
I didn't draw it to sell.

06:17.870 --> 06:20.040
I gave it to Alois, and...

06:20.830 --> 06:22.500
I don't want money for this.

06:23.170 --> 06:25.420
However, that wouldn't do.

06:26.040 --> 06:27.630
Just take this coin.

06:38.470 --> 06:40.520
Sir, I have to go back.

06:41.310 --> 06:42.520
Let's go, Patrash.

06:47.650 --> 06:48.690
What a brat.

07:03.710 --> 07:05.120
Grandpa, I'm home.

07:05.460 --> 07:07.709
Welcome back, Nello and Patrash.

07:07.710 --> 07:09.300
I'm sorry I'm late.

07:10.090 --> 07:11.710
Is there anything I can help with?

07:13.380 --> 07:15.799
The soup is ready now.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.429
Go and wash your hands.

07:17.430 --> 07:18.140
Yes.

07:38.910 --> 07:42.249
Amazing. It really looks like Alois.

07:42.250 --> 07:43.000
I told you, Mama.

07:43.960 --> 07:44.830
Yes.

07:44.831 --> 07:46.999
Nello is very good at drawing.

07:47.000 --> 07:49.379
He is very talented.

07:49.380 --> 07:50.250
Papa.

07:50.251 --> 07:52.010
May I put it on the fireplace?

07:54.840 --> 07:56.379
May I, Mama?

07:56.380 --> 07:57.180
Yes, yes.

07:57.590 --> 07:58.970
Put it there, put it there.

08:04.810 --> 08:05.770
Alois.

08:05.771 --> 08:07.020
Behave yourself.

08:07.520 --> 08:09.149
Sit down and eat your dinner.

08:09.150 --> 08:10.060
Yes.

08:21.240 --> 08:21.990
Alois.

08:23.080 --> 08:25.910
I don't want you to see Nello again.

08:26.620 --> 08:27.540
Why?

08:27.541 --> 08:29.330
Why can't I see him anymore?

08:31.250 --> 08:33.249
There isn't a reason.

08:33.250 --> 08:35.510
You are the only child of the Cojezs and...

08:35.840 --> 08:40.050
You will be going to a good
school for a better education.

08:41.010 --> 08:42.640
I am not going to a school.

08:43.140 --> 08:45.180
Nobody in this village is.

08:45.390 --> 08:47.480
You are different from the other children.

08:47.770 --> 08:49.019
I don't like you, Papa.

08:49.020 --> 08:50.980
I will not be going to a school.

08:51.480 --> 08:52.570
Thanks for the meal.

08:58.150 --> 08:59.159
Darling.

08:59.160 --> 09:01.030
You shouldn't have said it that way.

09:01.410 --> 09:04.330
When she goes to school,
she will see things differently.

09:04.700 --> 09:08.460
When she has new friends and
better knowledge, that is.

09:26.220 --> 09:27.140
Good.

09:27.141 --> 09:28.600
Are you ready?

09:29.850 --> 09:31.400
Are you all right, Grandpa?

09:35.230 --> 09:37.400
It's the usual pain from the old injury.

09:38.190 --> 09:39.780
Don't worry about it. Let's go.

09:51.210 --> 09:52.709
Blacky, you're in the way.

09:52.710 --> 09:54.250
Blacky, come back.

09:54.630 --> 09:55.999
Don't be naughty.

09:56.000 --> 09:57.380
Good morning, Mrs. Nulette.

09:58.130 --> 09:59.509
Good morning, Nello.

09:59.510 --> 10:01.590
Sorry about that.

10:02.090 --> 10:04.010
See you later, Blacky.

10:04.430 --> 10:05.600
We're going now.

10:07.680 --> 10:10.310
Nello is now a grown-up man.

10:12.060 --> 10:12.730
See you later.

10:28.790 --> 10:30.000
Thank you, Uncle.

10:36.590 --> 10:37.799
I appreciate it.

10:37.800 --> 10:38.380
Not at all.

10:39.050 --> 10:40.339
I appreciate it.

10:40.340 --> 10:42.010
Take care, Nello.

10:57.020 --> 10:58.110
Nello!

10:59.530 --> 11:00.530
Alois!

11:00.990 --> 11:02.400
Good morning, Nello!

11:03.490 --> 11:05.410
Yes, I'm coming now!

11:05.700 --> 11:07.530
Have a good day!

11:42.940 --> 11:43.990
Nello!

11:44.610 --> 11:45.990
George! Paul!

11:49.450 --> 11:51.449
Nello, I'll take care of this now.

11:51.450 --> 11:53.499
Go and have fun with your friends.
Patrash, you too.

11:53.500 --> 11:55.000
Thank you, Grandpa.

11:55.210 --> 11:57.710
Let's go, Nello!

12:26.030 --> 12:27.200
Lady Mary.

12:27.610 --> 12:31.700
Yesterday I made Mr. Cojez
angry, but I don't know why.

12:32.700 --> 12:36.460
I don't know why
I can't play with Alois.

12:55.640 --> 12:58.230
This town hasn't changed a bit.

12:58.730 --> 13:00.520
It was five years ago
when I was last here.

13:00.980 --> 13:03.520
One more glass.

13:07.150 --> 13:08.570
What's the matter with you, Nello?

13:09.990 --> 13:12.619
What's behind the curtain?

13:12.620 --> 13:14.290
What's inside, Nello?

13:16.200 --> 13:18.709
There are two paintings by Rubens.

13:18.710 --> 13:19.999
Rubens?

13:20.000 --> 13:23.919
I really want to see the paintings...
but I can't.

13:23.920 --> 13:24.959
Why not?

13:24.960 --> 13:26.590
Why can't you see?

13:27.210 --> 13:28.799
I have to pay for that.

13:28.800 --> 13:31.839
I have to pay a gold coin to look.

13:31.840 --> 13:33.929
A gold coin?

13:33.930 --> 13:38.769
A gold coin is a lot of
money, isn't it, brother?

13:38.770 --> 13:40.230
Well, of course it is.

13:41.730 --> 13:43.940
It'd be best to give up.

13:53.280 --> 13:56.699
What on earth are you doing, huh?

13:56.700 --> 13:57.750
Go, damn you.

14:01.170 --> 14:03.830
Go.

14:13.800 --> 14:15.430
I wonder what's wrong with him.

14:15.760 --> 14:18.430
He's been strange ever since
we went into town today.

14:19.390 --> 14:21.729
Oh, Mr. Hans. How are you doing?

14:21.730 --> 14:22.940
Is your grandpa at home?

14:23.730 --> 14:25.109
Yes, inside the house.

14:25.110 --> 14:26.400
Grandpa.

14:31.740 --> 14:33.489
Hello, Mr. Hans.

14:33.490 --> 14:36.660
Mr. Jehan, I need this month's rent today.

14:57.470 --> 14:58.560
This is it.

14:59.140 --> 15:01.309
Mr. Cojez was complaining about it.

15:01.310 --> 15:04.770
He doesn't want Miss Alois being drawn.

15:05.860 --> 15:08.320
You can't even afford a piece of paper.

15:08.690 --> 15:12.609
And you drew her on the back of a poster.

15:12.610 --> 15:14.320
How impolite of you to do such thing.

15:14.990 --> 15:17.240
I wish you would stay away from her.

15:17.780 --> 15:21.120
I am renting you this house.

15:21.450 --> 15:23.619
Please remember that.

15:23.620 --> 15:25.580
This is the rent, Mr. Hans.

15:29.630 --> 15:32.340
Good grief, always paying with small bills.

15:35.510 --> 15:38.180
Nello, I hope you understand
what I'm talking about.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.080
Nello.

16:01.580 --> 16:04.250
You keep drawing, no matter what they say.

16:04.580 --> 16:05.210
But...

16:05.830 --> 16:07.750
Don't worry about anything.

16:08.380 --> 16:12.169
I'm sure Alois likes your drawings too.

16:12.170 --> 16:13.090
Grandpa.

16:37.780 --> 16:40.780
It's strange... What's wrong with Alois?

16:45.370 --> 16:46.620
Nello!

16:54.380 --> 16:57.469
Nello, will you please take me to the town?

16:57.470 --> 16:58.930
You want to go into town?

16:59.930 --> 17:02.429
Papa is gone for business this morning...

17:02.430 --> 17:04.930
...and Mama told me to
play outside with you.

17:05.180 --> 17:06.769
Sorry for bothering you.

17:06.770 --> 17:09.440
Please take Alois with you.

17:10.560 --> 17:12.519
No problem.

17:12.520 --> 17:15.070
I'm sure Nello
and Patrash will be pleased.

17:17.030 --> 17:18.649
Thank you very much.

17:18.650 --> 17:19.659
Well, Alois.

17:19.660 --> 17:21.950
Please listen to Mr. Jehan.

17:22.450 --> 17:23.080
Yes.

17:24.540 --> 17:26.119
Well, let's hit the road.

17:26.120 --> 17:27.960
See you later, Mrs. Cojez.

17:28.330 --> 17:29.370
Have a safe trip.

17:32.500 --> 17:34.210
Nello, are we going to the market?

17:34.460 --> 17:36.920
If so, I'd like to buy
some strawberry candy.

17:45.510 --> 17:49.020
It has been a while since we
last went to Antwerp together.

17:49.940 --> 17:52.149
I think we were there during
the festival last year.

17:52.150 --> 17:54.019
I wonder where I want to go.

17:54.020 --> 17:55.609
I already bought
what I wanted to buy.

17:55.610 --> 17:57.860
I want to look at the scenery
from the hills with George.

17:59.570 --> 18:03.160
Yes, let's go. To all the places
you want to go, Alois.

18:12.920 --> 18:13.960
Oh! It's beautiful!

18:15.460 --> 18:16.840
Alois, it's dangerous.

18:19.800 --> 18:21.719
Pretty flowers...

18:21.720 --> 18:24.349
Every spring,
the flowers come out like this.

18:24.350 --> 18:26.560
You don't notice it since
you ride in the coach.

18:26.970 --> 18:28.470
I didn't know that.

18:28.810 --> 18:30.979
Nello, we'll be up ahead.

18:30.980 --> 18:31.600
Yes.

18:51.040 --> 18:52.619
That's right.

18:52.620 --> 18:53.790
What's the matter, Nello?

18:56.170 --> 18:58.130
This is the spot...

18:58.800 --> 19:00.510
...where Patrash was lying.

19:01.800 --> 19:04.180
Then, Nello, you found Patrash here?

19:06.260 --> 19:08.930
Yes, among red flowers,
just like this.

19:35.120 --> 19:37.000
It was a terrible man
who had Patrash.

19:38.170 --> 19:42.760
He didn't even give him water
and made him work so hard.

19:44.630 --> 19:46.719
Get up, Patrash.

19:46.720 --> 19:48.260
You're useless!

19:49.310 --> 19:50.430
Go now!

19:53.480 --> 19:55.019
I didn't know that.

19:55.020 --> 19:57.310
Patrash had such terrible days...

20:01.110 --> 20:02.150
Patrash, come.

20:04.240 --> 20:05.240
Here's some water.

20:07.410 --> 20:10.830
Patrash is so lucky
that you rescued him.

20:12.040 --> 20:13.250
Patrash.

20:33.220 --> 20:34.270
It's here.

20:36.230 --> 20:38.100
Patrash, please wait for us.

20:40.690 --> 20:42.650
Hello, Uncle.

20:43.360 --> 20:44.400
Hi, Nello.

20:44.780 --> 20:47.489
I knew you were coming.

20:47.490 --> 20:48.410
How do you do.

20:48.990 --> 20:52.529
Oh! You have a pretty lady with you today.

20:52.530 --> 20:53.240
Yes.

20:53.241 --> 20:56.120
She is my friend, Alois.

20:57.540 --> 20:59.210
Just a moment, Nello.

21:03.050 --> 21:03.670
There you go.

21:04.420 --> 21:05.709
You got so many!

21:05.710 --> 21:06.840
What are these, Nello?

21:07.300 --> 21:08.720
Oh, I see.

21:09.260 --> 21:10.969
You're going to draw on the back of them.

21:10.970 --> 21:15.599
Yes, I asked him
to save some used papers.

21:15.600 --> 21:16.270
Look!

21:17.480 --> 21:19.979
It'd be a waste to throw it away.

21:19.980 --> 21:21.020
You're right.

21:21.560 --> 21:22.820
Thank you very much.

21:28.820 --> 21:29.780
Sorry.

21:37.660 --> 21:38.160
There you go.

21:38.500 --> 21:39.330
Thank you.

21:52.340 --> 21:54.140
Get moving already!

22:27.300 --> 22:28.800
Why are you stopping?!

22:43.690 --> 22:46.360
Patrash. Thank you for waiting.

22:49.400 --> 22:51.070
What's the matter with you, Patrash?

22:52.530 --> 22:53.990
He's acting strange.

22:54.320 --> 22:58.790
Patrash, are you Patrash?!

22:58.990 --> 23:02.080
I see, it's you, Patrash.

23:12.170 --> 23:13.340
You're...!

23:15.260 --> 23:17.430
I didn't think you were alive.

23:17.720 --> 23:20.890
Great to see you again, Patrash.

23:21.310 --> 23:23.269
Nello, who is he?

23:23.270 --> 23:26.810
I am the owner of Patrash, this dog.

23:30.530 --> 23:34.359
I raised this dog
with care from a puppy...

23:34.360 --> 23:38.159
...but one day he disappeared.

23:38.160 --> 23:39.699
Let's go, Patrash.

23:39.700 --> 23:40.660
Wait, Mister!

23:41.040 --> 23:43.079
Patrash is my dog!

23:43.080 --> 23:45.249
That's right.
Patrash is Nello's dog!

23:45.250 --> 23:46.290
Shut up!

23:46.710 --> 23:47.580
Nello!

23:48.630 --> 23:50.669
Come, Patrash.

23:50.670 --> 23:52.460
Come with me. Come on.

23:53.170 --> 23:54.510
Push, Paul!

23:56.680 --> 23:58.140
Go! Go!

23:59.930 --> 24:01.099
Ah! What are you doing?!

24:01.100 --> 24:02.220
Stop!

24:03.520 --> 24:04.980
Patrash, run!

24:05.350 --> 24:06.689
Alois, get Patrash away.

24:06.690 --> 24:07.730
This way, Patrash.

24:14.190 --> 24:15.150
Let me go!

24:24.790 --> 24:26.869
Nello, are you all right?

24:26.870 --> 24:28.580
Are you all right, Nello?

24:44.980 --> 24:46.770
Move it. Get out of the way.

25:06.710 --> 25:07.620
Brother!

25:07.620 --> 25:08.540
All right, let's start.

25:08.541 --> 25:10.920
Come on...

25:12.210 --> 25:13.500
Over here!

25:27.890 --> 25:29.140
We did it!

25:45.120 --> 25:46.500
We did it!

25:51.540 --> 25:52.540
Run!

25:56.710 --> 25:58.380
Patrash, wait!

26:23.490 --> 26:25.160
Nello, we pulled it off!

26:26.540 --> 26:28.910
He was so upset.

26:29.500 --> 26:31.370
He's weird, brother.

26:31.830 --> 26:33.459
Hey, Nello.

26:33.460 --> 26:36.840
Never let him have Patrash, all right?

27:07.530 --> 27:08.490
Patrash.

27:21.170 --> 27:22.090
Patrash.

27:23.510 --> 27:24.720
Poor Patrash.

27:25.050 --> 27:26.890
You must be having a nightmare.

27:36.940 --> 27:38.400
You'll be all right now.

27:38.730 --> 27:39.860
It's all right now.

27:54.500 --> 27:58.539
Ouch... that kid's name is Nello, isn't it?

27:58.540 --> 28:00.299
Ah, Nello.

28:00.300 --> 28:01.510
Do you know him?

28:16.770 --> 28:18.019
Patrash!

28:18.020 --> 28:19.610
Where are you, Patrash?!

28:23.190 --> 28:25.449
You can't hide yourself this time.

28:25.450 --> 28:26.490
Come out!

28:28.570 --> 28:30.830
What can I do for you?

28:32.580 --> 28:34.040
"What"?!

28:34.410 --> 28:36.830
I want my dog back.

28:46.680 --> 28:49.009
Nello, listen.

28:49.010 --> 28:50.720
What's the matter, Mrs. Noulette?

28:53.640 --> 28:54.769
This is terrible!

28:54.770 --> 28:56.020
Who did this?

29:03.570 --> 29:04.530
Hey, kid!

29:04.860 --> 29:06.650
You really made fun of me.

29:09.740 --> 29:13.159
It seems like you've been
using Patrash for hard labor.

29:13.160 --> 29:15.290
Like dragging the milk jugs.

29:16.040 --> 29:20.420
But it has nothing to
do with me anymore now.

29:29.930 --> 29:30.760
Grandpa!

29:32.050 --> 29:33.640
Don't worry, Nello.

29:34.140 --> 29:37.890
Patrash is yours,
and nobody will take him away from you.

29:38.270 --> 29:39.140
Really?

29:39.520 --> 29:40.900
Is that true?

29:42.900 --> 29:44.270
Great!

29:44.940 --> 29:47.240
That's great, Patrash!

29:47.860 --> 29:52.370
It's all right now.
You'll be with us from now on!

30:02.460 --> 30:04.590
Patrash, that tickles.

30:07.800 --> 30:09.170
Geez, Patrash!

31:14.820 --> 31:16.240
Patrash!

31:24.370 --> 31:26.249
Alois is carrying hay?

31:26.250 --> 31:28.669
Yes, Mr. Cojez.

31:28.670 --> 31:32.379
Jehan is employed as a
worker on the farm...

31:32.380 --> 31:35.890
...but Nello let Alois do his job.

31:36.550 --> 31:39.850
Nello really is a bad kid.

31:40.180 --> 31:41.560
My daughter...

31:42.140 --> 31:44.230
He made my daughter work in the farm?

31:46.230 --> 31:46.980
Elina.

31:47.900 --> 31:50.729
Are you ready with her school preparations?

31:50.730 --> 31:52.569
Yes, but...

31:52.570 --> 31:53.700
I haven't talked to Alois yet.

31:54.150 --> 31:55.780
I'll talk to her about this.

31:56.740 --> 31:58.579
Send an application as soon as possible.

31:58.580 --> 31:59.200
Yes.

32:08.080 --> 32:09.250
See you later.

32:11.840 --> 32:13.880
Sorry that I can't go with you, Nello.

32:21.510 --> 32:22.679
You're alone this morning.

32:22.680 --> 32:23.100
Yes.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.690
Take care.

32:26.850 --> 32:28.099
Are you all right?

32:28.100 --> 32:28.520
Yes.

32:37.910 --> 32:38.950
Lady Mary.

32:39.660 --> 32:42.120
Please make my grandpa better.

32:50.130 --> 32:51.800
You're right.

33:07.270 --> 33:08.270
Alois!

33:08.900 --> 33:09.770
Nello!

33:13.190 --> 33:15.319
That must be a school uniform.

33:15.320 --> 33:16.570
You really look good in it.

33:18.990 --> 33:20.700
The uniform will get dirt on it.

33:21.200 --> 33:21.910
That's all right.

33:21.911 --> 33:22.950
I don't care about this uniform.

33:25.120 --> 33:26.040
Alois.

33:33.340 --> 33:37.010
Nello, I told you before.
I wish I didn't go to school.

33:42.140 --> 33:46.520
Nello, Papa and Mama told me that...

33:47.430 --> 33:50.399
...it would be fun to go to school...

33:50.400 --> 33:52.770
...and it's good for me to go.

33:53.150 --> 33:55.610
You also said that, but...

33:56.150 --> 33:57.859
I don't think it is true.

33:57.860 --> 34:01.950
Papa just wants me in school because
he doesn't want me to see you.

34:02.410 --> 34:04.910
After all, I can't see you...

34:05.290 --> 34:07.450
...as I have to stay in the
school until late afternoon.

34:08.290 --> 34:10.830
Not only that, Papa puts me in
a knitting class after school...

34:11.290 --> 34:12.830
...he wants me to write diary every day.

34:13.540 --> 34:16.590
I can't see Patrash either.

34:32.770 --> 34:33.520
Alois.

34:33.900 --> 34:35.820
School has just started.

34:36.900 --> 34:43.490
It will change soon, Alois.
That doesn't sound like you.

34:44.240 --> 34:45.160
But...

34:45.161 --> 34:48.540
You can see Patrash and me on the weekends.

34:49.040 --> 34:51.210
So, please cheer up.

34:53.170 --> 34:57.340
Alois, you'll make Patrash and
I worry if you look so sad.

35:00.800 --> 35:02.049
I'm sorry.

35:02.050 --> 35:05.350
You must feel more lonely than me, Nello.

35:06.050 --> 35:07.720
So, I guess I shouldn't complain.

35:09.100 --> 35:10.390
I have to go now.

35:10.810 --> 35:12.520
See you soon, Patrash.

35:23.320 --> 35:24.700
Nello!

35:37.630 --> 35:39.550
Brother, there are so many people.

35:40.840 --> 35:42.590
Something is written there.

35:43.470 --> 35:45.259
Brother, I can't see it.

35:45.260 --> 35:48.009
Even if we see it,
we can't read something that difficult.

35:48.010 --> 35:48.970
I see.

35:55.600 --> 35:56.650
Excuse me.

35:57.980 --> 36:00.150
What does it say?

36:00.820 --> 36:03.570
There will be a painting contest since
we have great paintings by Rubens.

36:03.990 --> 36:05.609
A painting contest?

36:05.610 --> 36:08.369
Anyone can participate it?

36:08.370 --> 36:11.160
Yes, anyone under eighteen years old.

36:11.660 --> 36:14.909
If you win the contest,
you'll get 200 francs.

36:14.910 --> 36:17.540
And you'll have a free
ticket to art school.

36:18.290 --> 36:19.670
That sounds great!

36:20.250 --> 36:21.709
Nello, you'll win for sure.

36:21.710 --> 36:23.339
You'll win for sure!

36:23.340 --> 36:24.920
Win for sure!

36:28.430 --> 36:29.680
Huh? What's with them?

36:30.600 --> 36:32.600
Nello, will you try?

36:32.970 --> 36:33.890
Will you try?

36:34.560 --> 36:36.890
Yes, I will try!

36:42.900 --> 36:46.780
If I win, I'll be able to go to
school, Patrash.

36:48.530 --> 36:49.620
If that happens...

36:51.200 --> 36:54.120
I'll be going to school
in Antwerp with Alois!

36:57.460 --> 37:01.790
But the panel will be very expensive.

37:04.920 --> 37:06.300
Grandpa, I'm home!

37:07.680 --> 37:09.179
Welcome back, Nello.

37:09.180 --> 37:10.640
Hello, Mr. Hans.

37:11.140 --> 37:15.519
Geez, I can't wait any longer.

37:15.520 --> 37:17.270
I'll go and wash the milk cans.

37:17.890 --> 37:21.019
You only paid me half last month.

37:21.020 --> 37:22.270
And now it happens again.

37:33.410 --> 37:37.080
If this will go on,
you will have to move out from the house.

37:44.340 --> 37:45.250
Grandpa.

37:45.590 --> 37:47.800
Nello, don't worry.

37:48.170 --> 37:49.340
Patrash...

37:49.800 --> 37:52.600
I mean, you spent the money for Patrash.

37:53.720 --> 37:55.389
I'm sorry, Grandpa.

37:55.390 --> 37:57.140
I didn't know anything.

37:57.810 --> 38:00.690
I didn't know you had to pay
that man all the money you had.

38:02.980 --> 38:05.940
Nello, Patrash is watching you.

38:12.450 --> 38:13.739
Patrash!

38:13.740 --> 38:17.290
Patrash, don't worry.

38:18.540 --> 38:21.370
It has nothing to do with you.

38:42.310 --> 38:42.980
Nello.

38:43.690 --> 38:45.060
Hello, Mister.

38:45.650 --> 38:48.190
Could you do me a favor?

38:48.530 --> 38:49.150
Yes.

38:52.990 --> 38:54.199
Hey, Nello!

38:54.200 --> 38:55.280
Nello!

38:56.370 --> 38:57.620
Where are you going?

38:58.490 --> 39:00.330
To the house of Mr. Kiesringel.

39:01.910 --> 39:04.210
Just a moment, we're coming too.

39:09.050 --> 39:11.009
What a big house this is.

39:11.010 --> 39:13.840
If a son of this house enters
his painting to the contest...

39:14.550 --> 39:15.890
...it might be a tough competition.

39:20.140 --> 39:22.310
Young Master, Stephan.

39:24.600 --> 39:27.150
Ah, it's here.
I have been waiting for it.

39:27.980 --> 39:29.859
Bring it in.

39:29.860 --> 39:31.110
Yes, I'll do it now.

39:34.660 --> 39:36.319
Here is the money.

39:36.320 --> 39:37.280
Thank you for bringing it in.

39:43.500 --> 39:45.499
Look, this is my panel!

39:45.500 --> 39:46.960
What happened?

39:47.290 --> 39:48.790
The owner gave it to me!

39:49.300 --> 39:50.880
Good for you, Nello.

39:51.920 --> 39:54.429
Mr. Aik, is that what you wanted?

39:54.430 --> 39:56.050
Yes, thank you.

40:04.980 --> 40:06.230
Do it well, please.

40:12.900 --> 40:14.990
O-Oh no.

40:23.370 --> 40:24.500
What?

40:24.830 --> 40:26.079
Alois and Nello are...!

40:26.080 --> 40:28.040
Yes, that's right!

40:28.580 --> 40:30.549
As soon as Jehan walked out...

40:30.550 --> 40:34.130
Nello took Miss Alois into the barn.

40:36.010 --> 40:37.049
Darling.

40:37.050 --> 40:39.389
They are still children.

40:39.390 --> 40:41.219
You don't have to worry about that.

40:41.220 --> 40:42.639
Oh, no.

40:42.640 --> 40:45.600
Although they are children, you never know.

40:48.020 --> 40:50.980
I can't tell what Nello is thinking about.

40:52.480 --> 40:56.150
I'm afraid that a strange rumor will spread
that will leave Miss Alois with a bad reputation.

40:59.870 --> 41:01.869
They can't even pay the rent.

41:01.870 --> 41:05.040
That kid, Nello, I don't like him.

41:08.580 --> 41:10.750
Never let Alois see Nello again.

41:11.420 --> 41:12.920
Never again.

42:06.140 --> 42:07.140
I'm home.

42:07.560 --> 42:08.930
Welcome back, Alois.

42:09.480 --> 42:10.560
Welcome home.

42:22.700 --> 42:23.620
Hans.

42:24.030 --> 42:25.579
Thank you.

42:25.580 --> 42:29.119
Oh, not at all. It was nothing.

42:29.120 --> 42:32.829
By the way,
I've heard you bought something.

42:32.830 --> 42:35.800
Yes, some clothes for winter.

42:36.210 --> 42:37.250
I see.

42:37.840 --> 42:41.759
I'll ask you to make a jacket for Alois.

42:41.760 --> 42:42.640
S-Sure.

42:59.360 --> 43:01.070
What is Alois doing?

43:01.650 --> 43:03.450
She is crying.

43:05.030 --> 43:06.200
If this goes on...

43:06.530 --> 43:08.080
She will become sick.

43:11.370 --> 43:13.710
Why can't she see Nello?

43:14.580 --> 43:17.500
Nello is a nice, honest boy.

43:18.300 --> 43:23.130
If you are concerned about
Nello's family situation...

43:26.760 --> 43:27.600
Darling.

43:28.180 --> 43:31.020
I love Alois very much.

43:31.640 --> 43:33.640
I want her to become happy.

43:57.210 --> 43:59.090
It got so rough...

44:03.130 --> 44:05.430
I'm sorry, Nello.

44:06.140 --> 44:09.510
You have been working so hard for me...

44:14.980 --> 44:16.100
Father...

44:16.940 --> 44:19.110
...please take care of Nello.

44:27.360 --> 44:30.490
If I'm gone, you will be...

44:34.870 --> 44:37.000
Really? Are you sure, mama?

44:37.960 --> 44:43.380
On your birthday, we will celebrate it and
the harvest with the people in the village.

44:44.130 --> 44:45.170
Nello too.

44:46.840 --> 44:47.890
Thank you, Mama!

44:51.310 --> 44:52.350
Papa!

44:55.890 --> 44:57.480
Papa, thank you!

45:03.610 --> 45:06.650
I see! On your birthday.

45:07.610 --> 45:09.450
Grandpa, is it all right for you to get up?

45:10.410 --> 45:12.739
Yes, since I've seen your lovely face.

45:12.740 --> 45:15.160
I feel much better.

45:16.290 --> 45:17.959
Geez, Grandpa.

45:17.960 --> 45:20.750
Nello and Patrash will be very happy.

45:21.170 --> 45:24.630
They will be at your party for sure.

45:25.010 --> 45:26.880
Please come with them, Grandpa.

45:27.720 --> 45:30.140
How old will you be, Alois?

45:30.930 --> 45:31.890
Nine years old.

45:32.850 --> 45:35.930
Nine, huh? You sure are grown up.

45:36.480 --> 45:40.519
I remember when you were born,
everybody in the village celebrated it.

45:40.520 --> 45:41.610
Really?

45:43.110 --> 45:48.989
Alois, please be a good friend
of Nello's forever, all right?

45:48.990 --> 45:50.699
Yes, of course.

45:50.700 --> 45:52.030
Please.

45:56.910 --> 45:59.079
It's been a while.

45:59.080 --> 46:02.460
The morning air is so fresh and nice.

46:03.500 --> 46:05.379
Are you all right, Grandpa?

46:05.380 --> 46:06.880
I'm all right.

46:08.670 --> 46:10.340
Grandpa, you should go back now.

46:24.360 --> 46:25.230
Grandpa?

46:25.610 --> 46:26.400
Nello.

46:27.150 --> 46:30.110
The town is filled with the
smell of frits, isn't it?

46:31.610 --> 46:33.949
After people harvested the potatoes...

46:33.950 --> 46:37.620
...there used be a lot of shops in town.

46:51.470 --> 46:52.300
Grandpa.

46:53.300 --> 46:54.720
You shouldn't walk too much.

46:55.510 --> 46:56.510
Yes, you are right.

47:00.600 --> 47:02.520
How about you, Grandpa?

47:03.230 --> 47:04.810
I'm fine, don't worry.

47:05.400 --> 47:06.900
Go on now.

47:09.280 --> 47:10.820
Yes, see you later.

47:47.650 --> 47:48.860
It's Nello.

47:49.730 --> 47:51.150
Stop the car.

47:51.740 --> 47:52.740
Nello!

47:53.280 --> 47:54.740
Hello, Mrs. Nulette!

47:55.820 --> 47:57.740
It's good to see you today.

47:58.200 --> 48:00.449
Nello, it's been a long time.

48:00.450 --> 48:01.500
Hello.

48:02.250 --> 48:03.040
Nello.

48:03.041 --> 48:06.789
My mother will stay with us for a while.

48:06.790 --> 48:09.289
Yes, the neuralgia is getting bad lately.

48:09.290 --> 48:10.379
Is that right?

48:10.380 --> 48:11.549
I'm sorry.

48:11.550 --> 48:15.259
I couldn't take care of your grandfather.

48:15.260 --> 48:16.679
Oh! Don't worry about him.

48:16.680 --> 48:18.389
We stopped by to see him...

48:18.390 --> 48:20.640
...but he was sleeping well.

48:21.720 --> 48:23.430
Please say hello to him for us.

48:24.140 --> 48:26.600
Yes, and please take care of yourself.

48:27.230 --> 48:28.940
Blacky, be a good boy.

48:32.990 --> 48:33.690
See you soon.

48:47.830 --> 48:51.340
I'll be back with you by Christmas.

49:30.630 --> 49:33.420
Oh, you are awake, Grandpa.

49:35.800 --> 49:38.220
Look! We bought some frits in the town.

49:40.510 --> 49:42.049
They are cold now.

49:42.050 --> 49:43.680
I will heat them up soon.

49:44.100 --> 49:45.470
The soup is ready too.

49:46.680 --> 49:48.640
And look at these flowers.

49:49.850 --> 49:52.650
It will be Alois' birthday tomorrow.

49:53.650 --> 49:58.400
Did you do it, Grandpa?
These are grown only in the woods.

49:58.610 --> 50:02.870
I, too, want to do something for
Alois to celebrate her birthday.

50:03.700 --> 50:06.410
She loves flowers, after all.

50:07.450 --> 50:09.160
That's right.

50:10.420 --> 50:12.170
She will be very happy.

50:30.850 --> 50:32.100
Here you go, Grandpa.

50:33.110 --> 50:34.480
Good smell.

50:34.900 --> 50:36.019
Frits.

50:36.020 --> 50:37.400
It's hot, so be careful.

50:49.120 --> 50:50.620
This is it.

50:51.120 --> 50:52.120
I'm glad.

50:52.710 --> 50:54.630
We'll eat here tonight.

50:55.000 --> 50:57.380
I'll bring yours too, Patrash.

51:02.130 --> 51:03.509
I am very happy tonight.

51:03.510 --> 51:06.049
I feel that I'm really lucky...

51:06.050 --> 51:08.810
...to have Grandpa and Patrash here.

51:09.810 --> 51:11.600
And I will be able to see Alois tomorrow.

51:19.070 --> 51:22.910
Grandpa, when you get better,
we'll go to the town together again.

51:26.780 --> 51:27.780
Grandpa!

51:29.240 --> 51:32.410
Grandpa! Hang in there, Grandpa!

51:40.050 --> 51:40.840
Nello...

51:41.630 --> 51:46.350
I'll soon be going to see your mother.

51:47.510 --> 51:48.969
No, Grandpa!

51:48.970 --> 51:50.560
Don't go anywhere!

51:52.310 --> 51:53.390
Nello...

51:54.900 --> 51:57.940
I want to stay here a little longer, but...

52:01.650 --> 52:03.820
If you have some kind of trouble...

52:04.360 --> 52:08.280
Go and see your neighbor Mrs. Nulette...

52:09.200 --> 52:12.040
I'm sure she'll help you.

52:13.370 --> 52:14.370
All right.

52:14.920 --> 52:16.830
I'll talk to Mrs. Nulette.

52:17.460 --> 52:19.500
I'll do what you told me, Grandpa.

52:21.510 --> 52:22.710
Good...

52:24.340 --> 52:25.130
Nello...

52:25.800 --> 52:27.430
My lovely Nello...

52:29.180 --> 52:31.219
You are so precious to me...

52:31.220 --> 52:33.019
I'll always be...

52:33.020 --> 52:35.730
...watching over you from heaven...

52:38.650 --> 52:40.480
Don't say that.

52:41.780 --> 52:42.940
Patrash...

52:48.820 --> 52:51.830
Take care of Nello...

53:00.840 --> 53:01.750
Grandpa...

53:03.590 --> 53:07.430
Paint a good picture, Nello...

53:15.270 --> 53:16.140
Grandpa?

53:18.730 --> 53:19.690
Grandpa!

53:26.490 --> 53:27.450
Grandpa!

53:28.280 --> 53:31.240
Don't leave me alone, Grandpa!

54:18.250 --> 54:19.459
What a long wait-

54:19.460 --> 54:20.750
It looks good to eat.

54:25.550 --> 54:28.419
I see everybody is here now.

54:28.420 --> 54:29.719
But, Nello is not here yet.

54:29.720 --> 54:31.760
We can't let them wait too long.

54:32.970 --> 54:34.350
We should start now.

54:36.970 --> 54:37.770
Alois!

55:14.340 --> 55:14.970
Nello.

55:15.640 --> 55:16.180
Oh no.

55:16.890 --> 55:19.180
That's right, Alois.

55:19.640 --> 55:21.690
Grandpa is dead.

55:23.520 --> 55:26.480
That's not true! That can't be true!

55:40.500 --> 55:41.500
Sorry.

55:42.040 --> 55:43.040
Grandpa...

55:43.540 --> 55:44.750
I didn't know that.

55:47.210 --> 55:49.710
Forgive me, Grandpa.

56:07.110 --> 56:08.480
There he comes, brother.

56:13.200 --> 56:15.910
You should have rested today.

56:17.120 --> 56:18.910
But, I must do this.

56:20.120 --> 56:21.699
Nello, please cheer up!

56:21.700 --> 56:24.709
Tell me if you need some help!

56:24.710 --> 56:26.460
And you have to cheer up, Patrash!

56:28.380 --> 56:29.670
Don't cry now, stupid.

56:44.020 --> 56:44.940
Grandpa.

56:49.940 --> 56:50.610
Nello...

56:55.700 --> 56:57.700
I picked it by the bridge.

56:58.320 --> 57:00.159
Oh, this is cute.

57:00.160 --> 57:02.329
But it's not mine.

57:02.330 --> 57:03.160
I see.

57:16.130 --> 57:18.890
Someone in the village
must have dropped it.

57:19.470 --> 57:21.640
I'll go and ask.

57:23.600 --> 57:24.470
Nello.

57:25.100 --> 57:27.350
Have you decided what you
will draw for the contest?

57:28.810 --> 57:31.610
I thought I would draw
Grandpa and Patrash, but...

57:32.190 --> 57:36.240
I can't remember Grandpa's face anymore.

57:38.280 --> 57:41.990
When I try to remember Grandpa's
smiling face, tears come up in my eyes.

57:42.330 --> 57:44.870
It's like it's raining in my head.

57:46.000 --> 57:46.790
Nello...

57:48.620 --> 57:52.590
It's funny that I can't remember his
face when I've been with him for so long.

58:02.550 --> 58:03.470
It's moving.

58:42.260 --> 58:43.640
It was fun.

58:43.970 --> 58:46.600
I'm glad to see you smiling again.

58:49.810 --> 58:51.140
Something is wrong.

58:51.940 --> 58:52.979
You're right.

58:52.980 --> 58:55.440
Papa was saying that something was
wrong with the windmill this morning.

59:17.670 --> 59:20.920
I'm supposed to give it
oil, but I don't know where.

59:21.550 --> 59:24.680
Mr. Cojez is asking too much of me lately.

59:25.850 --> 59:28.930
I guess I should wait for a mechanic.

01:00:06.800 --> 01:00:08.510
What is the matter, Patrash?

01:00:21.900 --> 01:00:22.780
The windmill!

01:00:54.020 --> 01:00:55.520
My windmill...

01:01:02.440 --> 01:01:04.490
Get water, hurry!

01:01:05.280 --> 01:01:06.360
Put out the fire!

01:01:24.840 --> 01:01:26.420
Get more water, hurry!

01:02:05.960 --> 01:02:07.090
Give me the water.

01:02:20.980 --> 01:02:22.980
The storage building is on fire too!

01:02:25.780 --> 01:02:28.320
My wheat is burning...

01:02:28.950 --> 01:02:32.450
We just harvested it last week, too...

01:03:50.110 --> 01:03:51.990
Why did it happen...

01:03:52.950 --> 01:03:53.860
Darling.

01:03:54.570 --> 01:03:56.240
The blades were not turning well...

01:03:57.120 --> 01:03:59.490
...and I told Hans to oil the shaft.

01:04:01.080 --> 01:04:03.579
I can't think of any
reason it would catch fire.

01:04:03.580 --> 01:04:04.999
Why now?

01:04:05.000 --> 01:04:07.499
Everything was going fine.

01:04:07.500 --> 01:04:10.380
Could it be that someone
started the fire intentionally?

01:04:13.170 --> 01:04:14.380
Hey, Nello.

01:04:14.840 --> 01:04:17.849
What were you doing by
the mill that evening?

01:04:17.850 --> 01:04:18.890
Tell me.

01:04:19.430 --> 01:04:22.730
I saw you running away
from the mill with the dog.

01:04:23.520 --> 01:04:24.390
Was it you?

01:04:25.140 --> 01:04:26.480
Did you start the fire?

01:04:27.980 --> 01:04:32.319
You started the fire as revenge
because I didn't let Alois see you.

01:04:32.320 --> 01:04:33.150
Darling.

01:04:33.570 --> 01:04:35.200
Nello would never do such a thing.

01:04:35.660 --> 01:04:38.910
I didn't! I didn't start the fire!

01:04:39.660 --> 01:04:41.789
Then what were you doing there?

01:04:41.790 --> 01:04:43.120
I was with Alois.

01:04:43.540 --> 01:04:44.750
With Alois?!

01:04:45.580 --> 01:04:47.540
You were with Alois?!

01:04:47.920 --> 01:04:48.630
Nello!

01:04:49.500 --> 01:04:51.420
I don't want to see you again.

01:04:51.960 --> 01:04:53.340
Stay away from Alois!

01:04:53.670 --> 01:04:54.550
Darling!

01:05:24.330 --> 01:05:25.080
Nello...

01:05:33.500 --> 01:05:35.469
I didn't do it!

01:05:35.470 --> 01:05:36.220
I didn't...

01:05:36.221 --> 01:05:38.430
I didn't start the fire!

01:05:55.280 --> 01:05:58.780
Nello, I'm sorry, but I don't need
you to carry the milk anymore.

01:05:59.950 --> 01:06:02.200
Don't come again tomorrow.

01:06:04.120 --> 01:06:05.700
Sorry, Nello.

01:06:14.710 --> 01:06:15.760
Patrash!

01:06:16.050 --> 01:06:17.379
It's all right.

01:06:17.380 --> 01:06:19.630
We don't go to town anymore.

01:06:21.590 --> 01:06:22.470
Darling.

01:06:22.760 --> 01:06:26.270
At least, we should ask
him to carry the milk.

01:06:26.720 --> 01:06:28.389
I can't do that.

01:06:28.390 --> 01:06:29.689
I'm sorry.

01:06:29.690 --> 01:06:31.520
Nello, please forgive us.

01:06:39.200 --> 01:06:40.240
Grandpa...

01:06:41.200 --> 01:06:44.120
I lost my milk delivery job today.

01:06:45.660 --> 01:06:46.870
What am I going to do now?

01:07:31.330 --> 01:07:33.830
Grandpa... Grandpa!

01:07:44.800 --> 01:07:45.800
Nello...

01:07:47.430 --> 01:07:48.560
Nello...

01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:51.640
Grandpa...

01:07:52.850 --> 01:07:55.900
Nello, you are not alone.

01:07:59.780 --> 01:08:01.279
You still have Alois.

01:08:01.280 --> 01:08:03.200
George and Paul too.

01:08:07.490 --> 01:08:11.250
I am always watching over you from heaven.

01:08:14.620 --> 01:08:15.630
Grandpa...

01:08:20.800 --> 01:08:21.840
Nello...

01:08:22.220 --> 01:08:24.880
Paint a good picture.

01:09:17.850 --> 01:09:18.690
It's done!

01:09:19.440 --> 01:09:20.860
Patrash, I've finished painting.

01:09:24.490 --> 01:09:25.900
Do you like it, Patrash?

01:09:38.370 --> 01:09:39.250
Grandpa...

01:09:39.750 --> 01:09:40.710
Thank you.

01:09:51.220 --> 01:09:52.760
It's snowing, Patrash.

01:09:54.100 --> 01:09:55.350
Let's go, Patrash.

01:10:10.200 --> 01:10:12.450
Alois, I've finished the painting.

01:10:14.580 --> 01:10:17.660
I'm glad, Nello. I'm glad.

01:10:28.260 --> 01:10:31.180
What, you want me to wait for the rent?

01:10:32.680 --> 01:10:36.350
I've waited long enough
for your grandpa's sake.

01:10:37.020 --> 01:10:39.810
If you can't pay me,
I want you to move out.

01:10:40.310 --> 01:10:41.270
Please.

01:10:41.730 --> 01:10:44.690
I'll pay it by Christmas.

01:10:45.190 --> 01:10:46.070
Christmas?

01:10:46.900 --> 01:10:51.030
How will you be able to pay me by
Christmas when you don't even have a job?

01:10:51.490 --> 01:10:53.779
I'll pay it by then for sure.

01:10:53.780 --> 01:10:55.910
If you can't, you'll move out of the house.

01:11:19.640 --> 01:11:20.680
It's Alois!

01:11:24.440 --> 01:11:26.610
Those are the cookies
that her mother baked.

01:11:29.860 --> 01:11:30.820
Patrash.

01:11:32.910 --> 01:11:34.780
We'll be all right by Christmas.

01:11:57.180 --> 01:12:01.269
In my opinion, this painting is excellent.

01:12:01.270 --> 01:12:04.150
That's right, I agree with you.

01:12:08.610 --> 01:12:11.239
Patrash, we'll be there soon.

01:12:11.240 --> 01:12:14.070
I'll feed you something good today.

01:12:15.820 --> 01:12:20.869
This child is not yet eighteen years old, but he has
expressed a great deal in this religious theme.

01:12:20.870 --> 01:12:23.040
I think it's not easy.

01:12:23.500 --> 01:12:25.580
This artist is the winner.

01:12:25.830 --> 01:12:28.380
But, will you look at
the painting next to it?

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:35.680
It's obvious that this artist had no formal education
in painting if I look at the brush strokes.

01:12:37.720 --> 01:12:42.350
But, he has depicted this old
man and dog in such a way that...

01:12:42.810 --> 01:12:46.480
...everybody can feel the warm
blood running through them.

01:12:47.770 --> 01:12:50.569
This is a good painting for sure, but...

01:12:50.570 --> 01:12:53.609
I'm not sure when it
comes down to the winner.

01:12:53.610 --> 01:12:55.239
I feel that way too.

01:12:55.240 --> 01:12:57.949
This painting is almost perfect and the
subject matter is chosen very well...

01:12:57.950 --> 01:13:01.490
I think the artist of this
painting should be the winner.

01:13:02.330 --> 01:13:04.750
I think Rubens' paintings move people...

01:13:05.500 --> 01:13:09.080
...because they appeal
to the people's heart...

01:13:09.500 --> 01:13:12.630
...and that's what I
look for in this contest.

01:13:18.640 --> 01:13:20.389
Appealing to the people's heart...

01:13:20.390 --> 01:13:22.389
I understand that, but...

01:13:22.390 --> 01:13:26.979
We can't just talk about the possibility
from a judge's point of view.

01:13:26.980 --> 01:13:32.440
It's not enough to be the winner.
I want to see a certain level of technique.

01:13:47.460 --> 01:13:49.880
Patrash, please wait for me here.

01:14:47.180 --> 01:14:53.230
Now, we are going to announce the
winner of the Rubens Painting Contest.

01:14:53.810 --> 01:14:58.190
After the careful deliberation
of the five judges...

01:14:58.570 --> 01:15:00.450
This year's winner is...

01:15:03.160 --> 01:15:05.330
Mr. Stephan Kiesringel.

01:15:21.260 --> 01:15:23.639
Now, Mr. Kiesringel...

01:15:23.640 --> 01:15:27.640
...receives the price of 200 franc
and free admission to art school.

01:15:54.540 --> 01:15:58.420
Congratulations, Stephan.

01:16:08.180 --> 01:16:11.179
Hurry, let's go have a party.

01:16:11.180 --> 01:16:12.060
Let's go!

01:16:14.560 --> 01:16:18.730
Grandpa, what am I...

01:16:52.930 --> 01:16:54.230
We're too late.

01:16:58.270 --> 01:16:59.190
Brother.

01:16:59.860 --> 01:17:01.690
Is that Nello's picture?

01:17:02.480 --> 01:17:03.240
Is it?

01:17:03.240 --> 01:17:04.030
Shut up!

01:17:20.290 --> 01:17:21.040
Sorry.

01:17:22.920 --> 01:17:24.470
Thank you, Patrash.

01:17:25.630 --> 01:17:27.130
Patrash, I'm sorry.

01:17:27.470 --> 01:17:29.800
That I couldn't feed you...

01:17:47.030 --> 01:17:48.110
Patrash!

01:18:16.270 --> 01:18:18.190
What's the matter, Patrash?

01:18:28.820 --> 01:18:30.360
What a huge amount of money.

01:18:57.850 --> 01:18:59.849
Hurry up, Hans. Hurry.

01:18:59.850 --> 01:19:00.640
Yes.

01:19:12.410 --> 01:19:16.240
Mama, if they don't find the
money, what will happen to us?

01:19:17.870 --> 01:19:20.539
I'm not sure. I don't know...

01:19:20.540 --> 01:19:23.919
...but we'll have to sell
this house and the land.

01:19:23.920 --> 01:19:25.170
This house?

01:19:26.210 --> 01:19:30.049
Papa finally borrowed it from the bank...

01:19:30.050 --> 01:19:33.929
...as he was going to pay those
whose crops have been burnt...

01:19:33.930 --> 01:19:37.310
...and he was thinking of
building a new windmill.

01:19:37.970 --> 01:19:39.520
The money is very important.

01:19:54.070 --> 01:19:54.870
Nello!

01:19:55.620 --> 01:19:56.450
Alois...

01:19:57.410 --> 01:20:00.080
I think this belongs to Mr. Cojez...

01:20:04.080 --> 01:20:05.580
Is this Papa's...

01:20:05.880 --> 01:20:07.590
Mama, come and see it.

01:20:07.790 --> 01:20:09.000
It's papa's bag.

01:20:10.260 --> 01:20:11.589
Nello, come in.

01:20:11.590 --> 01:20:13.130
Patrash, come in.

01:20:19.390 --> 01:20:20.639
What's the matter?

01:20:20.640 --> 01:20:21.560
Mama, look.

01:20:22.810 --> 01:20:24.979
When we were walking by the cave...

01:20:24.980 --> 01:20:26.610
Patrash found it beneath the snow.

01:20:27.060 --> 01:20:28.479
That's great.

01:20:28.480 --> 01:20:31.860
This is an important bag
that my husband lost.

01:20:32.650 --> 01:20:33.360
Is that right?

01:20:33.780 --> 01:20:34.860
Good.

01:20:37.200 --> 01:20:38.870
Thank you, Nello.

01:20:42.370 --> 01:20:43.710
Thank you, Nello.

01:20:44.250 --> 01:20:46.790
Thanks to you,
my family has been saved.

01:20:48.880 --> 01:20:50.250
Oh, you are so cold.

01:20:51.800 --> 01:20:54.090
I'll get you a hot soup now.

01:20:57.970 --> 01:20:59.930
Come here, Patrash.

01:21:05.600 --> 01:21:06.900
Poor Patrash.

01:21:07.230 --> 01:21:09.110
He must be very tired.

01:21:19.200 --> 01:21:20.120
Nello.

01:21:20.121 --> 01:21:21.910
We haven't seen each other
for a long time.

01:21:26.500 --> 01:21:27.290
Nello.

01:21:27.920 --> 01:21:28.710
Alois.

01:21:29.250 --> 01:21:31.800
I have something to tell you.

01:21:32.590 --> 01:21:34.630
It's all right.
You don't have to say anything.

01:21:35.720 --> 01:21:36.590
Alois.

01:21:38.010 --> 01:21:39.720
I went there today.

01:21:40.760 --> 01:21:41.680
But, Nello.

01:21:42.010 --> 01:21:45.060
Don't be disappointed
just because of that.

01:21:46.180 --> 01:21:47.060
Alois.

01:21:54.610 --> 01:21:57.399
You like Patrash, don't you, Alois?

01:21:57.400 --> 01:21:58.530
Of course.

01:21:58.910 --> 01:21:59.820
Good.

01:22:00.370 --> 01:22:02.780
Patrash is very hungry.

01:22:03.910 --> 01:22:06.659
I'll feed him a huge piece
of meat tonight.

01:22:06.660 --> 01:22:08.120
Wait for it, Patrash.

01:22:14.920 --> 01:22:15.840
Mama!

01:22:33.190 --> 01:22:34.650
I'm sorry, Patrash.

01:22:35.190 --> 01:22:37.190
Be happy with Alois.

01:22:48.870 --> 01:22:50.209
Thank you for waiting.

01:22:50.210 --> 01:22:51.580
Huh? Where is Nello?

01:22:52.630 --> 01:22:54.840
Patrash, it's your dinner.

01:23:14.150 --> 01:23:15.269
This is it.

01:23:15.270 --> 01:23:17.280
I'm ruined.

01:23:28.370 --> 01:23:29.160
This is...!

01:23:38.760 --> 01:23:40.720
M-My money!

01:23:42.880 --> 01:23:45.930
Patrash found it,
and Nello brought it here.

01:23:46.850 --> 01:23:47.640
Nello did?

01:23:48.770 --> 01:23:49.640
Yes.

01:23:49.641 --> 01:23:51.310
Nello sent it back for you.

01:24:01.110 --> 01:24:05.780
He could have used a coin to buy
food for himself and Patrash...

01:24:09.490 --> 01:24:10.290
I...

01:24:11.330 --> 01:24:14.250
I misunderstood Nello.

01:24:14.880 --> 01:24:16.130
I'm so sorry.

01:24:27.800 --> 01:24:29.100
Patrash.

01:24:30.100 --> 01:24:31.890
What's the matter?

01:24:35.650 --> 01:24:36.610
Patrash!

01:24:45.700 --> 01:24:47.200
Where are you going, Alois?

01:24:47.660 --> 01:24:48.580
I'm going...

01:24:48.581 --> 01:24:50.369
I'm going to Nello's house!

01:24:50.370 --> 01:24:52.080
It's dangerous in this snow!

01:24:53.120 --> 01:24:54.000
But...

01:24:54.540 --> 01:24:55.620
I'll go and see.

01:24:57.000 --> 01:24:58.590
You stay home, Alois.

01:24:58.880 --> 01:25:00.630
Please get inside.

01:25:12.310 --> 01:25:13.770
George! Paul!

01:25:16.600 --> 01:25:18.400
This is Mr. Aik.

01:25:21.940 --> 01:25:25.150
I'm a painter in Antwerp, Aik.

01:25:25.820 --> 01:25:33.700
As a judge in the painting contest,
I believed that Nello's painting was the best.

01:25:36.670 --> 01:25:41.040
I came here today in hope of helping him
learn in school and develop his talent.

01:25:44.050 --> 01:25:46.840
Where has Nello gone?

01:25:47.090 --> 01:25:48.840
He wasn't at home either.

01:25:49.510 --> 01:25:53.060
It's strange that the
house is all cleaned up.

01:25:56.520 --> 01:25:58.229
What is it, Hans?

01:25:58.230 --> 01:25:59.230
Well...

01:26:00.270 --> 01:26:01.560
Tell me.

01:26:02.230 --> 01:26:06.950
Well, Nello couldn't pay the rent...

01:26:07.240 --> 01:26:09.319
...so I told him to move out by Christmas.

01:26:09.320 --> 01:26:10.530
What did you say?!

01:26:11.740 --> 01:26:13.290
How could you do that?!

01:26:14.290 --> 01:26:15.830
I mean...

01:26:16.330 --> 01:26:17.790
You idiot!

01:28:35.220 --> 01:28:36.260
This is...

01:28:52.320 --> 01:28:53.450
Rubens'...

01:28:54.110 --> 01:28:55.530
Rubens' paintings.

01:29:29.860 --> 01:29:31.570
I finally see them.

01:29:37.410 --> 01:29:39.280
Ah, Lady Mary.

01:29:39.870 --> 01:29:41.119
Now...

01:29:41.120 --> 01:29:43.200
I feel I have no regrets.

01:30:10.020 --> 01:30:11.400
Patrash!

01:30:38.510 --> 01:30:39.969
Patrash...

01:30:39.970 --> 01:30:41.590
Take care of Nello.

01:31:36.270 --> 01:31:37.360
Patrash...

01:31:42.740 --> 01:31:43.949
Patrash...

01:31:43.950 --> 01:31:45.370
You came to me.

01:31:46.160 --> 01:31:47.200
Thank you.

01:31:49.580 --> 01:31:50.620
Yes, I know.

01:31:51.370 --> 01:31:52.370
We are...

01:31:53.210 --> 01:31:55.170
...always together.

01:31:59.840 --> 01:32:01.760
Look at that, Patrash.

01:32:02.680 --> 01:32:06.220
That is the Rubens painting
I wanted to see so much.

01:32:07.810 --> 01:32:09.390
And I finally saw it.

01:32:11.180 --> 01:32:12.230
Patrash...

01:32:13.100 --> 01:32:14.020
I am...

01:32:14.021 --> 01:32:15.650
...very happy now.

01:32:26.490 --> 01:32:27.910
You're tired, aren't you?

01:32:29.290 --> 01:32:30.410
So am I.

01:32:31.200 --> 01:32:34.420
Grandpa, I'm sorry.

01:32:35.540 --> 01:32:37.290
I want to rest now.

01:32:39.000 --> 01:32:40.090
Patrash.

01:32:40.630 --> 01:32:42.340
Let's go to sleep now.

01:34:34.700 --> 01:34:37.000
Nello!

01:35:11.070 --> 01:35:11.990
Alois.

01:35:16.450 --> 01:35:18.619
George, you are late.

01:35:18.620 --> 01:35:19.959
I'm sorry.

01:35:19.960 --> 01:35:23.880
Paul has just come back.

01:35:24.710 --> 01:35:25.420
Hi!

01:35:25.710 --> 01:35:26.879
Paul!

01:35:26.880 --> 01:35:28.340
It has been a long time.

01:35:29.130 --> 01:35:31.720
Mr. Cojez gave me a day off.

01:35:32.010 --> 01:35:35.179
Because the windmill is not busy now.

01:35:35.180 --> 01:35:36.010
Is that so?

01:35:36.350 --> 01:35:38.020
Are my Mama and Papa all right?

01:35:38.430 --> 01:35:38.980
Yes.

01:35:39.270 --> 01:35:41.190
They want you to come and see them.

01:35:43.690 --> 01:35:44.770
Mr. Cojez worries that...

01:35:45.150 --> 01:35:50.150
...you are working too hard in the
nunnery with those painful memories.

01:35:50.820 --> 01:35:52.570
"Painful memories"?

01:35:53.780 --> 01:35:56.910
I'm very busy with the children.
I have no time for memories.

01:35:57.240 --> 01:35:59.290
Sister!

01:35:59.660 --> 01:36:00.709
Hurry, hurry!

01:36:00.710 --> 01:36:02.539
Let's go to the market!

01:36:02.540 --> 01:36:04.249
Sister!

01:36:04.250 --> 01:36:07.249
I'm very happy to see them smiling.

01:36:07.250 --> 01:36:08.250
Is that so?

01:36:08.251 --> 01:36:12.339
All right, we'll take care of them today.

01:36:12.340 --> 01:36:13.630
Right, brother?

01:36:14.970 --> 01:36:17.389
I'll take them to the harbor
and put them on my ship.

01:36:17.390 --> 01:36:19.889
Oh, they will love it.

01:36:19.890 --> 01:36:21.060
Let's go now.

01:36:21.430 --> 01:36:22.390
Let's go.

01:36:34.570 --> 01:36:35.949
Alois...

01:36:35.950 --> 01:36:38.990
I'm always by your side...

01:36:40.370 --> 01:36:41.160
Nello.

01:37:18.660 --> 01:37:24.540
<i>I am awakened without reason.</i>

01:37:26.420 --> 01:37:31.460
<i>It's a restless kind of season.</i>

01:37:31.880 --> 01:37:35.050
<i>I hear the thunder.</i>

01:37:35.680 --> 01:37:38.590
<i>I hear the raindrops.</i>

01:37:39.550 --> 01:37:42.059
<i>Then I see rainbows,</i>

01:37:42.060 --> 01:37:46.600
<i>A rainbow of you.</i>

01:37:47.060 --> 01:37:54.110
<i>I can remember, just like that summer...</i>

01:37:54.490 --> 01:38:02.120
<i>The summer when I found a friend in you.</i>

01:38:02.870 --> 01:38:09.829
<i>When I cry, I call out your name.</i>

01:38:09.830 --> 01:38:14.419
<i>I can recall all, all that childhood...</i>

01:38:14.420 --> 01:38:19.720
<i>Like a dream that will never die, love.</i>

01:38:21.260 --> 01:38:23.889
<i>I am taking my sorrow...</i>

01:38:23.890 --> 01:38:27.769
<i>Then you bring me to the light.</i>

01:38:27.770 --> 01:38:34.609
<i>When I cry, I call out your name.</i>

01:38:34.610 --> 01:38:39.029
<i>Just touch me with heaven at my doorstep...</i>

01:38:39.030 --> 01:38:44.160
<i>To remind me that I won't be alone.</i>

01:38:46.120 --> 01:38:52.499
<i>Forever is kinder if it is
you who will remind me...</i>

01:38:52.500 --> 01:39:00.300
<i>That our love, no, it will not die.</i>

01:39:02.390 --> 01:39:07.480
<i>Show your face to me, my love.</i>

01:39:08.020 --> 01:39:11.689
<i>You are the star of next.</i>

01:39:11.690 --> 01:39:17.780
<i>Let me know your home...</i>

01:39:29.410 --> 01:39:34.630
<i>You are my prayer when it is night time...</i>

01:39:36.920 --> 01:39:42.130
<i>You give strength to my life light...</i>

01:39:42.550 --> 01:39:49.640
<i>Are you an angel, with all of your wonder?</i>

01:39:50.180 --> 01:39:57.400
<i>Are stars your gleam-mates within the sky?</i>

01:39:57.860 --> 01:40:05.449
<i>Can you still see me becoming a woman?</i>

01:40:05.450 --> 01:40:13.459
<i>Can you believe it has
been such a long time?</i>

01:40:13.460 --> 01:40:20.509
<i>When I cry, I call out your name.</i>

01:40:20.510 --> 01:40:24.889
<i>The echoes of strangers sound familiar...</i>

01:40:24.890 --> 01:40:30.640
<i>As if it were you I keep hearing.</i>

01:40:31.850 --> 01:40:38.269
<i>I don't want to follow
if it is here I belong...</i>

01:40:38.270 --> 01:40:45.239
<i>But it is true that I miss your smile.</i>

01:40:45.240 --> 01:40:49.540
<i>I will carry your memories
throughout my lifetime...</i>

01:40:49.790 --> 01:40:54.250
<i>To the winter's end and
through the summertime.</i>

01:40:56.710 --> 01:40:59.379
<i>I wipe away teardrops...</i>

01:40:59.380 --> 01:41:03.049
<i>Because I am stronger than I might know.</i>

01:41:03.050 --> 01:41:11.390
<i>When I cry, it won't be the same.</i>

01:41:11.890 --> 01:41:15.689
<i>But laughter of friends...</i>

01:41:15.690 --> 01:41:19.899
<i>Might hold in your hand...</i>

01:41:19.900 --> 01:41:26.159
<i>This is what life seems to be telling me.</i>

01:41:26.160 --> 01:41:29.779
<i>I need to see...</i>

01:41:29.780 --> 01:41:36.709
<i>When I cry, I can be set free.</i>

01:41:36.710 --> 01:41:41.249
<i>Like journeys of rivers to the ocean...</i>

01:41:41.250 --> 01:41:46.760
<i>It is like we are together for always.</i>

01:41:48.260 --> 01:41:50.759
<i>There is no denying...</i>

01:41:50.760 --> 01:41:54.559
<i>I found courage knowing your love.</i>

01:41:54.560 --> 01:42:03.230
<i>And I see you will always be...</i>

01:42:04.690 --> 01:42:09.910
<i>The sweetest lover that I had known...</i>

01:42:10.450 --> 01:42:14.870
<i>The sweetest friendship...</i>

01:42:16.250 --> 01:42:23.710
<i>You make me strong.</i>
